    old "就这样睡去。"
    new "Just fall asleep."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:570
translate english route1_start_3b5ac910:

    # centered_narrator "Demo到此结束，感谢游玩！"
    centered_narrator "This marks the end of the demo. Thanks for playing!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:571
translate english route1_start_183d81b4:

    # extend "\n欲知后事如何，还请在本作正式发售时继续支持！"
    extend "\nIf you wish to find out how Kaku and Shuang's struggle plays out, please continue to support us at the official launch!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:552
translate english route1_start_9343db20:

    # extend "\n恶心加剧，肠胃彻底拧成一团，而其中汹涌的内容物已经呼之欲出。"
    extend "\nThe nausea surged; your innards wrung into one tight knot, their churning contents already straining to break free."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:555
translate english route1_start_84da4c9a:

    # large_narrator "你死命闭气抵抗，汗如雨下，浑身冷颤使你几乎维持不住坐姿，眼看就要从座椅上滚下来。"
    large_narrator "You desperately held your breath trying to resist the urge to throw up, sweating all over. Chills ran through your entire being, almost making you unable to stay in your seat."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:556
translate english route1_start_11a0dabd:

    # extend "\n随着肠胃痉挛越发剧烈，你终究败在了本能反应面前，脖颈狠狠向前一抻，“哇”地一声吐了出来。"
    extend "\nAs the nausea kept intensifying, you eventually could no longer fight your reflexes. As your neck violently jerked forward, you started to throw up."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:562
translate english route1_start_24fdc7a4:

    # large_narrator "呕吐物与面前桌子接触的瞬间，水蓝的桌面便恢复了原本的颜色。"
    large_narrator "As the content of your puke made contact with the table in front of you, the azure-tainted tabletop immediately returned to the color of table cloth."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:563
translate english route1_start_63de7345:

    # extend "\n你吐出的色彩越多，这令人沮丧的还原就越发提速，转眼便侵蚀了大半个视野。"
    extend "\nThis upsetting regression accelerated as your vomit continued, soon covering the bulk of your vision."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:564
translate english route1_start_fa434e8a:

    # extend "\n色彩还原的地方，水面般摇曳的空间停止了动态，原本随处可见的王霜的微笑也随着视野的复原消散了。"
    extend "\nWhere the colors reached, the waving spatial texture ceased to move. Shuang's omnipresent smile also faded as your vision returned to normal."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:567
translate english route1_start_3549cf58:

    # large_narrator "桌布洁白，金属餐具冷峻，暖色的室内灯光随着呕吐物飘散，不断渗入空气中的每个角落。"
    large_narrator "Pale table cloths. Metallic silverwares. The warm indoor lighting dispersed along with the colors you threw up, seeping into every corner of the space."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:573
translate english route1_start_58b7ca8e:

    # extend "\n眼前桌面的存在与本质看起来产生了某种根本性的分离，但你已经没有心力去捕捉这种恼人的细节。"
    extend "\nThe form and the content of the table in front of you seemed to have experienced some sort of fundamental detachment, but you could no longer pay attention to such annoying subtleties."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:574
translate english route1_start_9add916b:

    # extend "\n因为你注意到，在美妙的水蓝色消逝殆尽后，王霜并没有回来。"
    extend "\nFor you have noticed that after the tantalizing azure waves faded, Shuang did not return."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:581
translate english route1_start_7ccc0795:

    # large_narrator "还原之后的世界仿佛脱了水般脆弱不堪，单是目光扫过就让其表面生出了一连串细小的裂痕。"
    large_narrator "The world after the regression was shriveled and brittle. Tiny cracks started to show simply with you laying eyes on its surface."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:584
translate english route1_start_7a40dd79:

    # extend "\n直到周身一切如同一幅缺乏保养的老旧油画那样，一片片剥落，露出背景里黑黢黢的虚空。"
    extend "\nUntil things around you started to fall in pieces like an unmaintained oil painting, exposing the pitch-black void behind it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:587
translate english route1_start_e2cb978c:

    # large_narrator "你明知该离开了，却仍旧无动于衷。"
    large_narrator "You knew that it was time to leave, and yet you remained unmoved."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:589
translate english route1_start_5308654d:

    # extend "\n{size=-10}只需要她带你离开这里...这样就够了...{/size}"
    extend "\n{size=-10}As long as she took me away from here...that will do it...{/size}"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:590
translate english route1_start_4c9642e4:

    # extend "\n{size=-10}只需要她...这样...就够了...{/size}"
    extend "\n{size=-10}As long as she...that...will be enough{/size}"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:594
translate english route1_start_9412c00c:

    # extend "\n就够了..."
    extend "\ni ask for nothing more..."


# game/scripts/route1.rpy:14
translate english route1_start_5d8f1b84:

    # ahe "嗯...那...倒不如去死...？"
    ahe "Mm...well...I'd rather just die...?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:28
translate english route1_start_87121b2d:

    # wangshuang "嗯，从之前的病史来看，你总是在这两个状态之间来回反复，但现在你是什么感觉呢？"
    wangshuang "Hmmm, from what I know about your history, you've been going back and forth between those two states constantly, but how do you feel right this moment? I want to hear your own words."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:31
translate english route1_start_ca568323:

    # wangshuang "啊...连这也说不出来么？"
    wangshuang "Ahh...not so easy, huh."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:33
translate english route1_start_a814a7e5:

    # wangshuang "那也可以聊聊你此刻看到的，或听到的，都可以聊，我在听呢。"
    wangshuang "If that is the case, then feel free to talk about what you are seeing, or what you are hearing. All is welcomed, and I'm listening."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:36
translate english route1_start_644a6ac5:

    # wangshuang "唔，原来如此，原来如此。"
    wangshuang "Mm. I see. I see."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:59
translate english route1_start_4381b057:

    # ahe "可它分明是我视野里最暴烈、最盛气凌人的东西了。"
    ahe "But it's clearly the most violent and arrogant thing I can see."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:63
translate english route1_start_12cb70c8:

    # wangshuang "那就闭上眼睛吧。那样你的问题便会迎刃而解了。"
    wangshuang "Then close your eyes. That solves all your problems."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:77
translate english route1_start_92e48c4e:

    # wangshuang "嗯，那样也是无可厚非的事情。"
    wangshuang "Well, sounds like you are fine then."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:83
translate english route1_start_1555f01f:

    # wangshuang "这是你的心理咨询。你是来访者，而我是咨询师。假如你连这种基本前提都不愿接受的话，你来这里又是为什么？"
    wangshuang "This is your consultation. You're the client, I'm the counselor. If you won't even take that much as given, what did you come here for?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:84
translate english route1_start_086bfa06:

    # ahe "可我确实想不起来啊...所以...我该怎样才能好起来？"
    ahe "But I really can't remember anything...so...what do I do to get better?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:95
translate english route1_start_742effa2:

    # wangshuang "说起时间，你要那东西有什么用？"
    wangshuang "Speaking of time - what do you do with that?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:100
translate english route1_start_d9c832d0:

    # wangshuang "我在听呢。"
    wangshuang "I'm listening."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:101
translate english route1_start_c915f143:

    # wangshuang "不用紧张的，阿鹤，你现在尽可以畅所欲言哦。如果说话还是有困难的话，尝试先闭上眼睛深呼吸一阵子，就像我之前教你的那样。"
    wangshuang "No need to tense up, Kaku. Say whatever you like. And if talking is still hard, close your eyes and breathe a while first - the way I taught you, remember?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:102
translate english route1_start_e29782bd:

    # ahe "...想不起来...什么都想不起来..."
    ahe "I can't...just can't think of anything..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:103
translate english route1_start_0de2d1ee:

    # wangshuang "那就试着想想你是怎么来到这里的，或者想想你在来这里之前正在做什么事，这些都能帮助你回忆过去。"
    wangshuang "Then try to recall how you got here, or what you were doing right before you came. Any of that will help you remember."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:104
translate english route1_start_1626e38c:

    # wangshuang "但即使什么也想不起来也不必懊恼，那是意料之中的事情。"
    wangshuang "But even if you can't think of anything, don't feel worried. That is all part of the process."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:111
translate english route1_start_ec038312:

    # wangshuang "不过，你还是没回答我的问题——时间对现在的你而言，有什么用？"
    wangshuang "But let's get back on track - what does time mean to you right now?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:112
translate english route1_start_7f6c0c04:

    # ahe "啊——啊——没用...完全没用...一切都结束了..."
    ahe "Agh——agh——Nothing...it means nothing...it's all...over..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:121
translate english route1_start_7bdee248:

    # wangshuang "那倒也不必谦虚啊，阿鹤。要知道，这件事少了你是绝对不可能成功的——领衔主演肯定得让给你，我当个制片人就行了。"
    wangshuang "No need to be that humble, Kaku. This feat will not be possible without you - so you will be leading the credit list for sure, as the main star. I'll be the producer."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:126
translate english route1_start_e95bae90:

    # ahe "可是我...我..."
    ahe "But I...I..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:130
translate english route1_start_65af19cc:

    # wangshuang "嗯，我懂的，阿鹤。在完成一件惊人的壮举后，出现冒充者综合征是非常常见的事情。但不论你怎么想，事已至此，还是放平心态最重要。"
    wangshuang "Yes, I completely get it, Kaku. After doing something as great as this, it's totally normal to feel like an imposter. But you know, what's done is done. Gotta look ahead."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:131
translate english route1_start_9155b49d:

    # ahe "...行啊...你就继续哔哔吧...随便了...随你便了..."
    ahe "...Sure...keep running your mouth...whatever...suit yourself..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:136
translate english route1_start_8fd91f5c:

    # wangshuang "{size=-10}这就是为什么我离——{/size}"
    wangshuang "{size=-10}That's why I can't ta——{/size}"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:141
translate english route1_start_e616013c:

    # wangshuang "没事。没事。阿鹤，你知道太阳为什么不会死吗？"
    wangshuang "Nothing. Nothing. Anyway, Kaku, do you know why the sun doesn't die?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:142
translate english route1_start_d68f6e5f:

    # ahe "因为它不想死？"
    ahe "Because it doesn't want to die?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:146
translate english route1_start_1b18efbf:

    # wangshuang "错咯——太阳自出生的那一刻起便像氢弹般持续自毁，早就动了死的念头，但它还是在天上烧了四十多亿年。"
    wangshuang "Womp womp - you see, the sun has been burning itself like a giant hydrogen bomb ever since its birth. It wanted to die from the get-go, yet it stayed up there, burning for over four billion years."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:149
translate english route1_start_b1058e11:

    # wangshuang "你当然不明白，你肯定在想‘可这明明也是外因导致的，毕竟整个太阳系都齐心协力地求它继续活下去’。"
    wangshuang "Of course you don't. You were probably thinking 'That's clearly due to external reasons, since the entire solar system is begging the sun to soldier on'."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:152
translate english route1_start_488f6fa2:

    # wangshuang "被我猜到了吧？然而现实恰恰相反——太阳不死仅仅是因为它的使命尚未完成而已。而它的死活与它或其他任何造物的想法，则是没有半点关系。"
    wangshuang "Called it, didn't I? But it's the exact opposite - the sun stays alive simply because it has not done what it's meant to do. Its mission is incomplete. And whether it lives or dies has nothing to do with the thoughts of anything else, even itself."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:162
translate english route1_start_5f2c95bb:

    # ahe "可我从来没有想过要出现在这里..."
    ahe "I never wanted to be here."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:164
translate english route1_start_a2e7baac:

    # ahe "所以我们在这里做什么？"
    ahe "So what are we doing here?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:165
translate english route1_start_fd0ece39:

    # wangshuang "这个嘛，你会明白的。"
    wangshuang "Well, you'll see soon."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:166
translate english route1_start_d906402a:

    # ahe "好吧...如果一切都无需解释，而我们又没有别的事情可以做，那我就只能在这里和你开瞪眼大赛了。"
    ahe "Ok fine...so if everything needs no explanation, and there's nothing else for us to do, I guess all we can do is a staring contest."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:168
translate english route1_start_44129caf:

    # ahe "哈...？"
    ahe "Huh...?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:169
translate english route1_start_5d10eefc:

    # wangshuang "嗯，就是那样，朴素，过程，都能听懂对吧？那样就够了。随便用言语去解释概念是会污染概念的，所以你还是不要再多探究了为好。"
    wangshuang "Mm, that's all it is. Plain. Process. You understand both words, don't you? Then that's enough. Explaining a concept with careless language only tarnishes it, so it would serve you well to stop asking questions."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:170
translate english route1_start_65922733:

    # ahe "哦...对对对...懂了...全都懂了...个鬼..."
    ahe "Ahhh I see...right, right, of course...I get it now...like hell I do..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:174
translate english route1_start_9a2c71ff:

    # wangshuang "但话说回来，瞪眼大赛啊，我，接受挑战！"
    wangshuang "But did you say you wanted to have a staring contest? I'm in!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:193
translate english route1_start_b6a5c62a:

    # ahe "自取其辱啊，阿霜。你从我们认识到现在为止有哪一次赢过么？"
    ahe "You asked for this, Shuang. Have you won once since the day we met?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:197
translate english route1_start_3cb37e54:

    # wangshuang "哼，你还有脸得意！能盯着你那张臭脸看这么久还不笑的就只有死人了。"
    wangshuang "Look who's talking! The only people that can stare at your resting bitch face without laughing are fucking dead people."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:198
translate english route1_start_2109443f:

    # ahe "嗯...所以我每天起床刷牙的时候都要死一次..."
    ahe "Hmmm...I guess I'd die once every morning when I brush my teeth..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:219
translate english route1_start_0c16f18a:

    # wangshuang "嗯，就这样对准，给我仔细看好了。"
    wangshuang "Now, make sure to take a good look."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:228
translate english route1_start_6d37aef9:

    # extend "\n你在一瞬间里双眼紧闭，整张脸上肌肉拧成一团，死死地挤压你抽搐的眼帘。但为时已晚，那令人绝望的强光已经在你脑海的更深处生了根。"
    extend "\nYou sealed your eyes shut as if your life depended on it, twisting the muscle near your eyelids just to ease the pain. But it was already too late. The despair-inducing glare had already found home in the deeper parts of your brain."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:229
translate english route1_start_fbfdb1e3:

    # split_right_page_narrator "随着炫目的光而来的，是蚀骨的火。这由内而外的火顺着你的双眼、你的视神经蔓延。后脑勺烧了起来，随后是整个大脑皮层，最终你的全身都在这挥之不去的炫光中熊熊灼烧。"
    split_right_page_narrator "Arriving with the blinding glare was a bone-gnawing flame. It dug all the way to the back of your head through your optic nerves, and soon set the entire cerebral cortex aflame. Your entire body caught on fire in no time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:239
translate english route1_start_f6fa638d:

    # large_narrator "那声音又响了起来。"
    large_narrator "The voice came again."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:240
translate english route1_start_f83a4248:

    # extend "\n——去找啊，否则这疼痛就永远不会有尽头。"
    extend "\n——Go find it, or else this agony would never subside."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:241
translate english route1_start_798eb01e:

    # extend "\n——去别处，就是这样。"
    extend "\n——To other places. That's the only way."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:242
translate english route1_start_f5c0e79d:

    # extend "\n——否则这疼痛就永远不会有尽头。"
    extend "\n——Or else this agony would never ever subside."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:243
translate english route1_start_e0295f6b:

    # extend "\n——你的大脑不会适应，你也绝无希望自我了断。"
    extend "\n——Your brain would never get used to it, nor would you be able to find an end to yourself."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:244
translate english route1_start_7ab677ed:

    # extend "\n——只能迈开步子。"
    extend "\n——All you could do was to start looking."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:245
translate english route1_start_b1a5c8ca:

    # extend "\n——只有这一个选择。"
    extend "\n——That was your only choice."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:246
translate english route1_start_9f14624e:

    # extend "\n——去找吧。"
    extend "\n——Go."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:249
translate english route1_start_fb6f730c:

    # large_narrator "——去无人的深海。"
    large_narrator "——To the deep sea where no one dwells."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:250
translate english route1_start_e5cd5430:

    # extend "\n——去银白的沙漠。"
    extend "\n——To the silver desert."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:251
translate english route1_start_f249b850:

    # extend "\n——去漆黑的深渊。"
    extend "\n——To the pitch-black abyss."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:252
translate english route1_start_a10ae9dd:

    # extend "\n——去伸手。"
    extend "\n——To reach out."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:253
translate english route1_start_27e2c55b:

    # extend "\n——去坠落。"
    extend "\n——To fall."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:254
translate english route1_start_03631cd2:

    # extend "\n——去沉默。"
    extend "\n——To wander in silence."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:255
translate english route1_start_7ac64298:

    # extend "\n——直到你再次回到这里为止。"
    extend "\n——Until you return to this place once again."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:279
translate english route1_start_1b79ebd1:

    # wangshuang "嗯？怎么了？"
    wangshuang "What's up?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:284
translate english route1_start_567c4e3a:

    # wangshuang "嗯，对。你盯着我发呆，我盯着你发呆，确实挺不得了的。"
    wangshuang "Yea, that's right. You staring into my eyes and me staring into yours. Truly some atrocious shit."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:297
translate english route1_start_eb429e55:

    # wangshuang "不如问问店家咯。"
    wangshuang "Maybe you should ask the shop owner."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:300
translate english route1_start_4159b6ab:

    # ahe "你是这儿的店员？而且天已经黑了。"
    ahe "You work here? And it's dark out already."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:323
translate english route1_start_fdab5fee:

    # wangshuang "彼此彼此咯，毕竟我们都只是遵循着强烈的愿望，尝试了一直以来想要尝试的事情。"
    wangshuang "You know very well that we did very similar things, following our very strong wants."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:324
translate english route1_start_73ae6900:

    # ahe "...区别在于我不需要人陪葬。"
    ahe "The difference is, I don't drag people down with me."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:349
translate english route1_start_37b8e196:

    # wangshuang "有件事你可能不知道，他们家团子是加了 KAS 才这么好吃的。"
    wangshuang "FYI, their mochi is good because it's laced with KAS."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:350
translate english route1_start_b38bf47d:

    # ahe "诶？所以之后我会上瘾？"
    ahe "Huh? So I probably will get addicted after this?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:352
translate english route1_start_82706f3b:

    # ahe "行吧，如果能让你从我眼前消失的话。"
    ahe "Fine. If it gets you out of my sight."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:354
translate english route1_start_b9eff6cf:

    # wangshuang "你见过哪门子的药能让东西凭空消失的？而且靠染上新瘾来戒旧瘾可是个无底洞啊。"
    wangshuang "That shit doesn't exist, my man. You've ever seen a drug that makes things vanish into thin air? Besides, fighting old addictions with new ones is a real rabbit hole, mind you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:355
translate english route1_start_2bae5f31:

    # ahe "那你还让我吃？以及你自己不也在做同样的事情？"
    ahe "So why are you letting me eat it? And as if you're not doing the same thing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:356
translate english route1_start_289b239a:

    # wangshuang "那确实还是有点不想看着你和我坠入同样的深渊嘛，毕竟我还挺在乎你的。不过最后还是好奇心赢了，嘿嘿嘿。"
    wangshuang "My my, I just don't want to see people I appreciate going down the same degenerate path I did, you know. But in the end curiosity won out, hehehe."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:362
translate english route1_start_f87581f1:

    # ahe "王霜？真心话？这两个概念居然能够产生任何关联？"
    ahe "Dr. Wang Shuang? Honest? Didn't know those two words could sit in the same sentence."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:363
translate english route1_start_ba7207af:

    # wangshuang "连真心话都分不清，以后可是要吃大亏的哦。"
    wangshuang "If you can't tell the two apart, you'll be in for some serious trouble down the road."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:369
translate english route1_start_468c3288:

    # wangshuang "KAS 生理上确实不成瘾啊，只是太多人会陷进它能让人看到的那些东西，最后心理上产生依赖了，所以你才能在安息地见到那么多活死人。"
    wangshuang "KAS really isn't physiologically addictive. It's just that too many got hooked to the shit they see in those visions, and end up psychologically dependent. That's why you see so many KAS zombies out in the streets in Grave Town."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:370
translate english route1_start_7f1ab139:

    # ahe "那我看我估计危险。"
    ahe "Then I'm probably done for."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:371
translate english route1_start_23269371:

    # wangshuang "所以嘛，你到底会怎样呢，阿鹤？我很期待哦。"
    wangshuang "So? How will you turn out, Kaku? I'm honestly quite curious."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:372
translate english route1_start_7a178570:

    # ahe "可是只致幻的话岂不是很无聊？尤其对你来讲。"
    ahe "But isn't it boring for you if it's just some psychedelics?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:376
translate english route1_start_86e344e7:

    # wangshuang "无聊？可别太刺激了！你知道十二小时起步的感官过载是什么感觉吗？五感全部推到极限，尤其是视觉，所有东西的颜色都比平时看到的要鲜艳无数倍，而且全都彼此交融，到最后视野里就是五彩斑斓的白。"
    wangshuang "Boring? You're kidding me! Can you comprehend what twelve hours of cognitive overload feels like? When all your senses are pushed to their limits, especially your vision. Everything has mad vibrant colors, and they are seeping into each other, and in the end all you see is a white that expresses all colors."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:377
translate english route1_start_9d734baf:

    # wangshuang "所有东西都是饱满到极致的，你懂我意思吗？不单是感官上的饱满，而是存在上的饱满，第四维度上的饱满——是那种...不论我们怎么干涉都无法改变的东西。"
    wangshuang "Everything is full to the fullest, you know what I mean? Like it's not 'full' in the sense of any perception, but in the sense of existence, on the fourth dimension. It's like...the state that we will never be able to intervene or interpret."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:378
translate english route1_start_13f6870a:

    # wangshuang "然后脑子里就只剩一个念头：“我操这下不得了了要被外界存在的压强挤碎了快他妈跑”，然后据说，我就开始往窗户外面跳...？也不知道是被谁拉住的，是你吗？应该不是，你应该拽不住我。"
    wangshuang 'And I was like "Holy fucking shit this crap is absolutely going out of control I\'m getting squeezed to death by the pressure of this thing that I don\'t comprehend I must get the fuck out ASAP", and...'
    wangshuang "I heard I was trying to jump out of the window? Did you grab me? Were you there? Nah you probably couldn't grab me in time."
    wangshuang "I heard I was trying to jump out of the window? Did you grab me? Were you there? Nah you probably couldn't grab me in time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:382
translate english route1_start_7b6d9dbf:

    # wangshuang "总之要不是后来配了眼镜，不然我是绝对不敢再用KAS的，那次是真的差点死了..."
    wangshuang "Anyway if it wasn't for my glasses later, I could never ever touch KAS ever again. Shit actually almost killed me that time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:383
translate english route1_start_17d5e5fa:

    # ahe "哦，这样一来你那“磕完药差点死掉的小故事集”就又有新章节可以更新了咯。"
    ahe 'Huh, I guess your "Tales of almost dying after slamming drugs" is still getting new chapters.'

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:388
translate english route1_start_519d921a:

    # wangshuang "不过一般人的反应应该不会那么夸张。你会喜欢的，我觉得。"
    wangshuang "But you know, I'm more like an outlier with the condition I have. You would probably like it, is my guess."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:437
translate english route1_start_e5b005c1:

    # "从它那轻若无物又变幻莫测的形态来看，可能真是什么珍馐也说不定。当然，是另一剂猛药的可能性绝对更大。"
    "Judging by its weightless, ever-shifting form, it might really be some kind of delicacy. Though of course, another potent drug is by far the likelier possibility."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:438
translate english route1_start_8fe9e0d0:

    # "但无论如何，在 KAS 即将穿过血脑屏障的前一刻，再往身体里追加不明物质想必不是什么明智决定。"
    "As KAS was about to go through your blood brain barrier, adding more substances into your blood stream was likely not a wise idea."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:439
translate english route1_start_94be6724:

    # "你并不准备在来到这破地方的第一晚就这样放飞自我。"
    "You weren't about to get this wasted on your first night in this dump."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:440
translate english route1_start_8dfa23a2:

    # ahe "算了吧，都吃过团子了。"
    ahe "Forget it. I've already had the mochi."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:441
translate english route1_start_77b68ef3:

    # wangshuang "哦，那随你便咯——说起来啊，阿鹤，你喜欢红色还是蓝色？"
    wangshuang "Suit yourself - by the way, Kaku, do you prefer red or blue?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:444
translate english route1_start_f32a9730:

    # "虽然你清楚地意识到你跳动的血管里，KAS 即将穿越脑血屏障，随时可能把你的意识送上云端，可你那该死的好奇心还是压过了残存的理性。"
    "Even though you knew full well that KAS was about to cross the blood brain barrier in your pulsing veins, and was about to send your consciousness over to cloud nine at any second, your damn curiosity took over."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:447
translate english route1_start_35639c0d:

    # "你毫无戒心地将那不明物件送进嘴里，简单地咀嚼了一阵，没有尝出任何味道就囫囵吞下了。"
    "You shoved the object into your mouth without giving it much thought. After an intense chewing session, not much taste came out of it, so you swallowed it whole."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:449
translate english route1_start_ce617998:

    # "…"
    "…"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:450
translate english route1_start_aec08ceb:

    # extend "\n……"
    extend "\n……"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:451
translate english route1_start_4bfaa876:

    # extend "\n………"
    extend "\n………"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:453
translate english route1_start_e987d55f:

    # ahe "没味道啊。"
    ahe "It's tasteless."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:454
translate english route1_start_01b4731b:

    # wangshuang "哦？嗯...那好像也是其中一种可能性...算正常吧。"
    wangshuang "Oh? Hmm...I suppose that's one of the possibilities. Normal enough."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:455
translate english route1_start_b7d5c03a:

    # ahe "所以接下来会怎样？"
    ahe "So what happens now?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:456
translate english route1_start_59cdfdfd:

    # wangshuang "这个嘛，你马上就会见到了——所以说阿鹤，你喜欢红色还是蓝色？"
    wangshuang "Well, you'll find out soon enough - so tell me, Kaku, do you prefer red or blue?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:488
translate english route1_start_07023f2e:

    # extend "\n成瘾。糖分子的洪流。只消一个浪头就使你染上了挥之不去的瘾。"
    extend "\nAddiction. The flood of sugar needed nothing more than a small wave to get you completely hooked."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:505
translate english route1_start_8e26e21f:

    # ahe "如此甜蜜..."
    ahe "So sweet..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:513
translate english route1_start_be965aed:

    # wangshuang "那就这样继续下去吧。只要你继续睁着眼睛，这一切就不会消失。"
    wangshuang "Then on we go. Keep your eyes open and none of this has to end."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:516
translate english route1_start_c26dec77:

    # wangshuang "无妨，就这样睡去也无可厚非。"
    wangshuang "No harm in it. There's nothing to fault about just falling asleep."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:522
translate english route1_start_929a3c9b:

    # extend "\n蓝色空间里的凉爽糖分让你浑身的燥热与恶意消减了大半，你置身一片透明的海域里，又像是漂浮在空洞的宇宙空间中。"
    extend "\nThe chilly sugar dissolving in the azure space has cured the malice and heat that was surging across your entire body. You were simply drifting in the middle of a deep sea, as though floating within the void of the deep space."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:534
translate english route1_start_4d78bc8f:

    # large_narrator "你的知能越是提升，它的样貌就越发模糊，谜样的面容中只显露出一抹依稀可见的残酷笑容，仿佛在嘲讽你的徒劳。"
    large_narrator "The stronger your mental acuity, the blurrier its shape. All you could see was a cruel grin shining through, as though mocking your futile attempts to comprehend its fullness."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:566
translate english route1_start_47fa979c:

    # extend "\n面前盘子里躺着几个没吃完的团子，团子上面糖浆的金黄色泽明艳地让你毛骨悚然。"
    extend "\nA few unfinished mochi lay in the plate in front of you. The golden glaze on them frightened you to the core."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:567
translate english route1_start_d7555baa:

    # extend "\n胃里再次翻腾起来。你赶紧移开了目光。"
    extend "\nYou felt your stomach becoming restless again, so you swiftly turned your gaze away."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:581
translate english route1_start_852cc487:

    # extend "\n直到它们在空间中汇聚成令人不安的绵延裂隙。"
    extend "\nUntil they converged into an unsettling chasm."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:586
translate english route1_start_cd17cdaa:

    # extend "\n周身空间在微颤中继续碎裂，而你则带着某种同样脆弱的信念静坐原地，任凭倦意侵蚀你脑海中残存的意识。"
    extend "\nThe space around you continued to shatter as it trembled. And you stayed in your seat, holding onto a certain faith as brittle as the space around you, letting fatigue encroach away on your already shattered mind."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:593
translate english route1_start_91413a9c:

    # extend "\n即便如此，王霜依旧没有回来。"
    extend "\nBut despite your fragile conviction, Shuang never returned."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:608
translate english route1_start_794dec7f:

    # ahe "阿霜？"
    ahe "Shuang?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:609
translate english route1_start_1095e693:

    # extend "\n你在吗？"
    extend "\nYou there?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:610
translate english route1_start_1523a025:

    # extend "\n你要是再假装消失的话我就要去死咯？"
    extend "\nPull another disappearing act and I'll go die, you know."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:613
translate english route1_start_794dec7f_1:

    # ahe "阿霜？"
    ahe "Shuang?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:614
translate english route1_start_a972da5a:

    # extend "\n有人吗？"
    extend "\nAnyone?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:620
translate english route1_start_a9169992:

    # large_narrator "没有人。周身只有一片暧昧的粉红色雾气。"
    large_narrator "No one. Only a vague pink haze covering your entire body."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:621
translate english route1_start_dfd58948:

    # extend "\n试着蜷起手指，只觉得手心传来一阵稍纵即逝的触感，冰凉而虚幻。"
    extend "\nYou tried to curl your fingers. Something brushed your palm and was gone - cold, and not quite real."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:622
translate english route1_start_a86d9412:

    # extend "\n你挣扎着想要活动身体，却猛地意识到自己的横膈膜停止了张弛。"
    extend "\nYou fought to move, and understood with a lurch that your diaphragm had stopped."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:625
translate english route1_start_7c6c544e:

    # centered_large_narrator "请保持呼吸。"
    centered_large_narrator "Please keep breathing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:630
translate english route1_start_94c486d6:

    # large_narrator "空气中充斥着一股微妙的甜腻味道。"
    large_narrator "The air smelled faintly sweet."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:631
translate english route1_start_6acb30e1:

    # extend "\n粉红色的？"
    extend "\nPink, was it?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:632
translate english route1_start_c182ef76:

    # extend "\n在童年故乡的某个傍晚，太阳将要落山，你踌躇满志地幻想未来时，也闻到过这样的味道。"
    extend "\nYou had smelled this before. During an evening in your hometown, when the sun went down, and your head full of your bright futures."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:633
translate english route1_start_4461b2a0:

    # extend "\n它让你想起一些美好但没有意义的事情。"
    extend "\nIt brought back things that were lovely and meaningless."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:634
translate english route1_start_e29fca98:

    # extend "\n无论如何也没法从中逃离，但请保持呼吸。"
    extend "\nThere was no getting out of it. But please keep breathing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:637
translate english route1_start_53656dce:

    # large_narrator "你漂浮着。"
    large_narrator "You drifted."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:638
translate english route1_start_db1867dd:

    # extend "\n腹中偶有痉挛，就像方才经历了一场盛大的呕吐。"
    extend "\nYour stomach cramped now and then, the way it does after a long bout of vomiting."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:639
translate english route1_start_31cac6b2:

    # extend "\n吐到浑身只剩下电流与心跳。"
    extend "\nVomited down to nothing but current and heartbeat."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:640
translate english route1_start_221ce3c5:

    # extend "\n色彩与声音。"
    extend "\nColor and sound."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:643
translate english route1_start_a7df489b:

    # centered_large_narrator "原来如此，原来如此。"
    centered_large_narrator "I see. I see."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:646
translate english route1_start_fdbe526e:

    # large_narrator "请严肃呕吐。"
    large_narrator "Please vomit responsibly."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:647
translate english route1_start_05baab79:

    # extend "\n只要能够继续呼吸。"
    extend "\nSo long as you go on breathing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:650
translate english route1_start_52a544e2:

    # large_narrator "请不要脱水。"
    large_narrator "Please do not dehydrate."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:651
translate english route1_start_4f6b55ff:

    # extend "\n请不要腐烂。"
    extend "\nPlease do not rot."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:652
translate english route1_start_c6c3603e:

    # extend "\n请不要在恒温动物的皮囊里窒息。"
    extend "\nPlease do not suffocate inside the hide of a warm-blooded animal."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:658
translate english route1_start_2def0463:

    # large_narrator "——录入中——录入中——"
    large_narrator "——RECORDING——RECORDING——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:659
translate english route1_start_8e73382f:

    # extend "\n——接下来将对生体失窃案的犯罪嫌疑人进行问询。"
    extend "\n——The suspect in the biologics theft case will now be interrogated."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:662
translate english route1_start_6fcf277d:

    # extend "\n——请问，您盗窃本公司的生体产品，是出于自主意愿，还是有他人指使？"
    extend "\n——Please state: was your theft of the company's biologic product an act of your own volition, or were you instructed by another party?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:667
translate english route1_start_8ff0de9f:

    # extend "\n——录入完毕——"
    extend "\n——RECORDING COMPLETE——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:671
translate english route1_start_55f31131:

    # large_narrator "凝胶柔软。"
    large_narrator "The gel was soft."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:672
translate english route1_start_d37a74d3:

    # extend "\n玻璃也柔软。"
    extend "\nThe glass was soft too."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:673
translate english route1_start_b5665280:

    # extend "\n黑夜柔软。"
    extend "\nThe night was soft."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:674
translate english route1_start_f70ba551:

    # extend "\n光源柔软。"
    extend "\nThe light was soft."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:675
translate english route1_start_e4837586:

    # extend "\n粉红色雾气却坚硬如铁。"
    extend "\nThe pink haze, however, was hard as steel."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:678
translate english route1_start_cd4de51d:

    # large_narrator "需要时刻监测的数据点："
    large_narrator "Data points requiring continuous monitoring:"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:679
translate english route1_start_063def63:

    # extend "\n生命体征。"
    extend "\nVital signs."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:680
translate english route1_start_e3f796fb:

    # extend "\n死亡体征。"
    extend "\nMortal signs."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:681
translate english route1_start_8340c053:

    # extend "\n不可有误。"
    extend "\nNo errors permitted."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:682
translate english route1_start_99962a75:

    # extend "\n脑电波。"
    extend "\nBrainwaves."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:683
translate english route1_start_99962a75_1:

    # extend "\n脑电波。"
    extend "\nBrainwaves."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:684
translate english route1_start_5ffc8d92:

    # extend "\n————————————？"
    extend "\n————————————？"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:685
translate english route1_start_43c3348f:

    # extend "\n有误。"
    extend "\nError."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:689
translate english route1_start_9eb62f07:

    # large_narrator "——插入记忆——"
    large_narrator "——INSERTING MEMORY——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:690
translate english route1_start_51e74d42:

    # extend "\n——连续24小时的核磁共振？小意思！除非这人的骨头是铁做的——？"
    extend "\n——Twenty-four straight hours of MRI? Child's play! Unless this one's bones are made of iron——?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:691
translate english route1_start_db1d5e2b:

    # extend "\n——当然，即使如此，让他被由内而外地彻底烤熟，也不失为一种凄美悲壮的结局。"
    extend "\n——Though even then, cooking him through from the inside out would make for a fairly tragic and beautiful ending."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:692
translate english route1_start_d5671222:

    # extend "\n——所以...会继续监测的。"
    extend "\n——So...we'll keep monitoring."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:693
translate english route1_start_c31afd93:

    # extend "\n——因为那正是...目的...盛大地收...后为后人所铭记，哈哈。现在的年轻人啊..."
    extend "\n——Because that's exactly the...point...go out grand...and be remembered after. Ha. Kids these days..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:694
translate english route1_start_b47d886c:

    # extend "\n——…的理想？"
    extend "\n——...the ideal?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:695
translate english route1_start_836a4e83:

    # extend "\n——理想？说得好像你这年近三十的__是一个十三岁的孩子。"
    extend "\n——Ideal? You say that like this pushing-thirty __ of yours is a boy of thirteen."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:696
translate english route1_start_3f7af5d9:

    # extend "\n——同时，请务必...忘记..."
    extend "\n——And in the meantime, be sure to...forget..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:697
translate english route1_start_cc75c696:

    # extend "\n——弹出中——弹出中——"
    extend "\n——EJECTING——EJECTING——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:702
translate english route1_start_362d0730:

    # large_narrator "——读取——读取——"
    large_narrator "——READING——READING——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:703
translate english route1_start_da1c14fb:

    # extend "\n所以你会为我保持呼吸么？"
    extend "\nSo will you keep breathing, for me?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:704
translate english route1_start_dbc812cb:

    # extend "\n为我拆出旁人的肋骨，为我洞穿无辜者的肺叶？"
    extend "\nWill you pull the ribs out of strangers for me? Will you put holes through innocent lungs for me?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:705
translate english route1_start_c5e4073f:

    # extend "\n为我毫无理由地献上溢美之词？"
    extend "\nHeap praise on me for no reason at all?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:706
translate english route1_start_ec35b8e4:

    # extend "\n赠予我自由？"
    extend "\nHand me freedom?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:707
translate english route1_start_204b7c1c:

    # extend "\n赠予我死亡？"
    extend "\nHand me death?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:708
translate english route1_start_3eff46bd:

    # extend "\n无趣。"
    extend "\nBoring."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:709
translate english route1_start_065f2beb:

    # extend "\n但请保持呼吸。"
    extend "\nBut please keep breathing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:710
translate english route1_start_dec6ea9f:

    # extend "\n——读取失败——"
    extend "\n——READ FAILED——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:715
translate english route1_start_98623b46:

    # ahe "哦。"
    ahe "Oh."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:716
translate english route1_start_cd70b7a2:

    # ahe "呃..."
    ahe "Ugh..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:717
translate english route1_start_ee6758f7:

    # ahe "啊...！"
    ahe "Ah...!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:719
translate english route1_start_6d822c72:

    # large_narrator "横膈膜早就停止了张弛，当你意识到自己无法呼吸时，一切已经晚了。"
    large_narrator "Your diaphragm had stopped long before. By the time you understood you couldn't breathe, it was far too late."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:720
translate english route1_start_7a99afbe:

    # extend "\n你感到浑身发胀。那是因为粉红色的神经毒素正顺着透明细长的针刺注入你的血管。"
    extend "\nYou felt yourself swelling. That was the pink neurotoxin going into your veins down many long clear needles around you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:721
translate english route1_start_03cdfc30:

    # extend "\n直到你全身都染上粉红色。"
    extend "\nUntil all of you had gone pink."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:724
translate english route1_start_2f733b07:

    # large_narrator "粉红色的雾气散成一丝丝隐约可见的、游移的细线——水母的触手。"
    large_narrator "The pink haze came apart into thin drifting threads - a jellyfish, and its tentacles."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:725
translate english route1_start_39a74f32:

    # extend "\n这分明是一场长期疗程的开端，却因为视线模糊而永远定格在了肤浅的一面。"
    extend "\nIt was the opening of a long course of treatment. Your blurred sight caught only its shallowest aspect, and froze it there for good."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:726
translate english route1_start_6405ad34:

    # extend "\n——杀人的也罢，懦弱的也罢，捏成一个便是了。"
    extend "\n——Murderer or coward, knead them into one and be done with it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:727
translate english route1_start_916a88c0:

    # extend "\n——剧毒的也罢，解毒的也罢，混成一锅就行了。"
    extend "\n——Poison or antidote, boil them in one pot and be done with it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:728
translate english route1_start_ef2d2427:

    # extend "\n总之要合而为一，总之要并联，总之要揉碎了再捏起来，总之即使不为了重生也要毁灭。"
    extend "\nBe one, whatever it takes. Be wired in parallel. Be crushed and packed back together. Be destroyed, even if nothing is reborn from it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:729
translate english route1_start_d5b6e409:

    # extend "\n总之必须要保持呼吸。"
    extend "\nAnd keep breathing, whatever it takes."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:734
translate english route1_start_1a56256f:

    # large_narrator "你想了起她的善。"
    large_narrator "You remembered her kindness."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:735
translate english route1_start_3c2da55e:

    # extend "\n你只能想起她的善。"
    extend "\nYou could remember nothing but her kindness."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:736
translate english route1_start_c5d79742:

    # extend "\n在这水母勾勒的温暖牢笼里，你只被允许想起她的善。"
    extend "\nInside the warm cage the jellyfish had drawn, her kindness was all you were permitted to remember."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:737
translate english route1_start_70e6fea8:

    # extend "\n伞盖边缘在你看不到的远处有节奏地收缩舒张。每一根触手都与你相连。"
    extend "\nSomewhere past your sight the rim of the jellyfish bell opened and closed in rhythm. Every tentacle ran back to you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:738
translate english route1_start_6d0dbe20:

    # extend "\n触手连接肌肤的地方，火苗在跳动。"
    extend "\nWhere they met your skin, small flames sparkled."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:741
translate english route1_start_2811b56c:

    # large_narrator "呼吸停止的那一刻，你感到舌尖有些麻木。"
    large_narrator "The moment your breathing stopped, the tip of your tongue went numb."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:742
translate english route1_start_182d1ac1:

    # extend "\n一股苦涩液体自喉管深处涌上来。"
    extend "\nSomething bitter climbed up out of your throat."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:743
translate english route1_start_fd7d6280:

    # extend "\n却在抵达舌尖的瞬间消散了。"
    extend "\nAnd broke apart the instant it reached your tongue."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:744
translate english route1_start_86e3c837:

    # extend "\n所以说，要保持呼吸道畅通。"
    extend "\nWhich is to say: keep the airway clear."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:745
translate english route1_start_c2f5e29c:

    # extend "\n请保持呼吸。"
    extend "\nPlease keep breathing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:752
translate english route1_start_df317338:

    # large_narrator "她是治愈的灰，包容的灰。"
    large_narrator "She was the gray of healing. The gray that takes you in."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:753
translate english route1_start_755dd55d:

    # extend "\n任何色彩倾泻其中，都只能归零的灰。"
    extend "\nPour any color into it and the gray returns it to zero."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:754
translate english route1_start_c4b25be1:

    # extend "\n灰在扩散，由点到面，最后变得像一帘浩大的幕布般徐徐展开。"
    extend "\nThe gray spread, point to plane, until it opened like one enormous curtain drawing back."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:755
translate english route1_start_2e6debae:

    # extend "\n所以追求“还原”何罪之有？"
    extend "\nSo what is the crime in wanting things to regress?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:758
translate english route1_start_ffdd2951:

    # large_narrator "你只能眼睁睁地看着面前的灰幕展开。"
    large_narrator "All you could do was watch the gray curtain open in front of you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:759
translate english route1_start_1582fb40:

    # extend "\n无能为力。"
    extend "\nNothing else you could do."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:760
translate english route1_start_555868a2:

    # extend "\n因为还原的灰幕此刻也是你的愿望。"
    extend "\nBecause the restoring gray was your wish too, right this moment."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:761
translate english route1_start_efeeaa1e:

    # extend "\n即使身处灰幕下就必须遭受你拼尽全力也难以忍受的疼痛。"
    extend "\nEven if living under it meant pain you could barely hold with everything you had."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:762
translate english route1_start_54166fa3:

    # extend "\n嚎叫。歇斯底里的嚎叫。你在嚎叫中睡去又醒来。"
    extend "\nHowling. Hysterical howling. You howled yourself to sleep and howled yourself awake."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:763
translate english route1_start_01d36da1:

    # extend "\n你并不明白自己为何嚎叫，明明只是感到疼痛而已。"
    extend "\nYou didn't know why you were howling. You were only in pain."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:764
translate english route1_start_8a908264:

    # extend "\n也许那源自一种强加于你的欢欣，使你由衷地庆祝一个陌生灵魂的自由。"
    extend "\nMaybe it came from a joy forced on you, so that you celebrated the freedom of a soul you had never met."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:768
translate english route1_start_5be8d979:

    # extend "\n所以还要保持呼吸么？"
    extend "\nSo will you keep breathing?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:772
translate english route1_start_11fdb519_4:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:778
translate english route1_start_d44c4c77:

    # extend "\n灰幕的蔓延永无止境，一如疼痛的叠加永无止境。"
    extend "\nThe gray spreads without end, the way pain stacks without end."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:804
translate english route1_start_54b8975a:

    # large_narrator "主动放弃呼吸后，你在视野的余光中瞥见了某种远大于你的存在，祂在召唤你。"
    large_narrator "The moment you let your breathing go, something far larger than you moved at the edge of your sight. It was calling you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:805
translate english route1_start_357d9d62:

    # extend "\n耳畔传来细弱的声音，那嗓音神秘而熟悉 - 你的病终究与我一样，我羸弱的爱人。"
    extend "\nA thin voice reached your ear, strange yet familiar - your sickness is mine after all, my frail love."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:806
translate english route1_start_701d0332:

    # extend "\n你听见那声音，就像听见了复活的钟声，虽然振聋发聩，却使你义无反顾地站了起来。"
    extend "\nYou heard it the way you'd hear bells for the resurrection. Deafening. And it put you on your feet without a moment's argument."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:809
translate english route1_start_860e0360:

    # extend "\n治病也罢，杀人也罢。"
    extend "\nTo heal, or to kill."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:838
translate english route1_start_f44c0403:

    # wangshuang "喂，到了没啊？"
    wangshuang "Hey. Are we there yet?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:841
translate english route1_start_daa1f00d:

    # wangshuang "那还要走多久？"
    wangshuang "Then how much further?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:842
translate english route1_start_5d21a0ca:

    # ahe "到不了了。"
    ahe "We're never getting there, it seems."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:845
translate english route1_start_63164949:

    # ahe "或者说我们早就到了，但找不到对的骨头。"
    ahe "Or we got here ages ago, and I just can't find the right bone."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:847
translate english route1_start_e5aa00d0:

    # wangshuang "你就一定要拼出一副完整的骨架才满意么？"
    wangshuang "You really need a whole skeleton before you're satisfied?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:848
translate english route1_start_64d333b3:

    # ahe "不然好像我们也走不出这里。"
    ahe "Otherwise it doesn't look like we're walking out of here either."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:850
translate english route1_start_4ed35234:

    # ahe "不是挺好的么？像你这样整天坐办公室的，偶尔就需要走动走动。"
    ahe "Isn't this nice, though? Someone who sits at a desk all day needs to stretch their legs now and then."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:855
translate english route1_start_23e2ffdf:

    # wangshuang "呃呃呃我究竟中了什么邪才把你——"
    wangshuang "Ugh, ugh, ugh - what possessed me to ever take you..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:856
translate english route1_start_4283a1c9:

    # ahe "嗯？把我怎么？"
    ahe "Hm? Take me where?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:858
translate english route1_start_27510d70:

    # wangshuang "没事，别在意。"
    wangshuang "Nothing. Never mind."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:864
translate english route1_start_1732a216:

    # ahe "嗯...大腿骨明明应该是最容易找到的才对..."
    ahe "Hmm...the femur should be the easiest one of all to find..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:866
translate english route1_start_c0339bcf:

    # wangshuang "这根不是？"
    wangshuang "Not this one?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:867
translate english route1_start_3b0778a1:

    # ahe "那根我刚才试过了，髋关节对不上。"
    ahe "Tried it. The hip joint doesn't line up."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:868
translate english route1_start_cf75ae0c:

    # wangshuang "这边还有四五根，你都试过了？"
    wangshuang "There's another four or five over here. Tried them all?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:869
translate english route1_start_a6e13261:

    # ahe "诶？你是从哪儿找来的？"
    ahe "Huh? Where did you get those?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:871
translate english route1_start_d238c662:

    # wangshuang "来的时候遍地都是啊，眼前一眼望去还有七八根。"
    wangshuang "They were lying everywhere on the way in. I can see seven or eight more from where I'm standing."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:872
translate english route1_start_fd191b72:

    # ahe "所以精神科的也得会认骨头？"
    ahe "So psychiatrists have to know their bones now?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:874
translate english route1_start_f63fbb9c:

    # wangshuang "骨科可是我的强项。"
    wangshuang "Orthopedics happens to be my strong suit."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:875
translate english route1_start_f653fb42:

    # ahe "好吧..."
    ahe "Alright..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:877
translate english route1_start_ce617998_1:

    # "…"
    "…"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:878
translate english route1_start_aec08ceb_1:

    # extend "\n……"
    extend "\n……"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:879
translate english route1_start_4bfaa876_1:

    # extend "\n………"
    extend "\n………"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:881
translate english route1_start_f812c9f6:

    # ahe "对上了诶。"
    ahe "It fits."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:884
translate english route1_start_aa7c26c9:

    # ahe "头骨..."
    ahe "The skull..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:889
translate english route1_start_ebe9dafb:

    # ahe "嗯？"
    ahe "Hm?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:890
translate english route1_start_5ed01e72:

    # wangshuang "你知道自己在做什么，对吧？"
    wangshuang "You know what you're doing. Right?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:907
translate english route1_start_e1c4c49b:

    # wangshuang "因为我也能做同样的梦。"
    wangshuang "Because I can have the same dream."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:916
translate english route1_start_4c70fa63:

    # ahe "可如果你已经变成神了——"
    ahe "But if you've already turned into a god——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:923
translate english route1_start_69163cb1:

    # ahe "什么研究？"
    ahe "What study?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:925
translate english route1_start_91ad9a82:

    # wangshuang "‘全知全能的代价’。"
    wangshuang "'The Price of Omniscience'."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:928
translate english route1_start_75fd9c26:

    # wangshuang "别急，听我讲完你就懂了。"
    wangshuang "Patience. Hear me out and you'll get it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:930
translate english route1_start_8c66042b:

    # wangshuang "所谓‘全知全能’，虽然听着像是造物主才被允许拥有的力量，但事实上以今天的技术，想要在有限时空里模拟这一状态不算难。"
    wangshuang "'Omniscience' sounds like something only a God gets to have. But with today's tech, simulating it inside a bounded space and time isn't actually that hard."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:932
translate english route1_start_71340cf0:

    # wangshuang "试想，假若在我们与杰罗瓦的最后一战里，你在见到他放出的尤里娅的那一刻们就放弃了抵抗，会怎么样？一切就结束了对吧？"
    wangshuang "Picture it. Our last fight with Jerowald - say you'd given up the moment you saw the Julias he let loose. It's all over, right?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:934
translate english route1_start_c3524eba:

    # wangshuang "那你再想，如果我能把这段不存在的“记忆”高清模拟出来，数据化掉，然后灌回你脑子里。"
    wangshuang "Now picture me simulating that 'memory' - the one that never happened - in full fidelity, turning it into data, and pouring it back into your head."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:936
translate english route1_start_f9ec6764:

    # wangshuang "加上你脑子里原本就存在的记忆，这时让你同时体验选择支两边的事件，那在这样的认知草拟完成后，你是不是就已经实现对于这段记忆的‘全知全能’了？"
    wangshuang "Stack it on the memory already in there and you live both sides of the branch at once. Once that draft finishes, haven't you achieved 'omniscience' over that stretch of your life?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:939
translate english route1_start_3c943f31:

    # wangshuang "当然，但假若两边的记忆，从肢体感官到事件次序，无不张弛有度地印在你脑海里，那对于一个不了解认知草拟的被试来说，该如何戳穿自己‘全知全能’的假象？"
    wangshuang "Of course. But if both sets of memories are printed in with the exact same level of fidelity - every sensation perfectly real, every event in perfect order - how is a subject who's never heard of cognitive drafting supposed to puncture their own omniscience?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:940
translate english route1_start_f3af9390:

    # ahe "必须要外人点破才行。"
    ahe "Someone outside would have to say it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:942
translate english route1_start_51c7fef1:

    # wangshuang "对，但不全对——即使有外人指出矛盾，又有多少人愿意摒弃自己的“切身体验”，转而允许他人的只言片语来定夺自己的认知？"
    wangshuang "Yes, and no - even when an outsider points at the contradiction, how many people will throw out what they lived through and let somebody else's few words decide what they know?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:947
translate english route1_start_e82ac697:

    # wangshuang "没错。我们人工植入的认知流并没有在结尾处安排收束性事件，而在我们灌进去的认知与现实发生冲突后，被试们全部选择了无视现实，并开始自行草拟选择支两边的后续内容。"
    wangshuang "Exactly. The stream we implanted had no closing event, and once it collided with reality every subject ignored reality and started writing the rest of both branches themselves."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:949
translate english route1_start_60b61748:

    # wangshuang "更有意思的是，所有被试在自行草拟的过程中多巴胺通路都在暴走，就仿佛这虚假的全知全能让他们——"
    wangshuang "Better still, every one of them had their dopamine pathway going wild while they did it. As though the counterfeit omniscience had them..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:950
translate english route1_start_87f9a535:

    # ahe "成瘾了。"
    ahe "Addicted."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:952
translate english route1_start_6dca90fd:

    # wangshuang "Bingo！我们用计算生成的认知数据让人染上了成瘾性的精神分裂，而这——"
    wangshuang "Bingo! We gave people an addictive schizophrenia out of computed cognition, and that..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:953
translate english route1_start_e5184273:

    # ahe "就是全知全能的代价？"
    ahe "——is the price of omniscience?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:955
translate english route1_start_ab42c8ae:

    # wangshuang "嘿嘿，别兴奋过头了，阿鹤。"
    wangshuang "Heheh. Don't get carried away, Kaku."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:956
translate english route1_start_88379bd5:

    # wangshuang "一个人双线程草拟时需要的算力...这么说吧，会在草拟开始后的短时间内爆炸增长，而最初的草拟全是在被试脑内执行的...。"
    wangshuang "The compute one person needs to run two threads at once...put it this way, it goes vertical almost immediately. And the earliest cognitive drafting all ran inside the subject's own head..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:959
translate english route1_start_a0fa0dec:

    # wangshuang "嗯，第一批被试的脑子大多都烧了，物理意义上的。后来第二批还动用了医院的计算机集群，最后效果也没好多少就是..."
    wangshuang "Get it? Most of the first cohort's brains burned out. Physically. The second cohort got the hospital's compute cluster and it barely helped..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:961
translate english route1_start_4c1f6528:

    # wangshuang "所以说能后悔是好事啊，能用如此低成本的认知模式来替代脑细胞被烧干，是一桩好买卖。"
    wangshuang "So regret is a gift! Being able to feel a sensation this cheap instead of having your brain cells cooked dry - that's a hell of a trade."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:962
translate english route1_start_aae3c441:

    # ahe "那这个梦..."
    ahe "Then this dream..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:964
translate english route1_start_19ca5422:

    # wangshuang "嗯，是我给自己搭的，用来强制认知收束的疗养院。后来发现效果不错，自然也就向一些VIP们开放咯。"
    wangshuang "Yea, I built it for myself. A sanatorium for forcing convergence. It worked well enough that I opened it to a few VIPs."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:965
translate english route1_start_f4082fba:

    # ahe "你自己也参与了？"
    ahe "You went through it yourself?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:966
translate english route1_start_43fa2e4e:

    # wangshuang "当然，我可是第一批被试。只是我的脑子不太一样，成瘾这个问题对我来说并不存在，可以随时自行结束草拟，所以可以在当被试的同时一边跟进实验。"
    wangshuang "Obviously. First cohort. My head just runs differently - addiction isn't a problem for me, so I can end a draft whenever I want. So I got to be a subject and run the experiment at the same time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:967
translate english route1_start_4c47e515:

    # ahe "所以为什么没有让其他被试来这里..."
    ahe "Then why weren't the other subjects brought here..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:969
translate english route1_start_f7636976:

    # wangshuang "哦...哈哈...这个嘛，毕竟当时搭得比较匆忙，这个梦境第一版的认知收束任务只能单线程地跑，慢得不行的同时还会很吃资源，所以就算开放了也救不了太多人...哈哈..."
    wangshuang "Oh...haha...well. It went up in a hurry, and the first version could only run convergence single-threaded. Painfully slow, ate resources, so even open it couldn't save many people...haha..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:977
translate english route1_start_b74baca5:

    # ahe "这就是你后悔的事情？"
    ahe "Is this the thing you regret?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:979
translate english route1_start_7c17c08a:

    # wangshuang "你觉得呢？"
    wangshuang "What do you think?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:980
translate english route1_start_ef1072a0:

    # ahe "我怎么知道..."
    ahe "How would I know..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:982
translate english route1_start_6fa4f504:

    # ahe "只要你心安理得就行..."
    ahe "As long as you can live with yourself..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:985
translate english route1_start_11193390:

    # ahe "所以这梦也是你那朴素过程的一部分？"
    ahe "So this dream is part of that plain process of yours, too?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:987
translate english route1_start_90c2b104:

    # wangshuang "那可不一样，现在能够来到这里的都是游离于朴素过程之外的异客。当他们离开这里时，我希望他们至少能明白自己为什么会这样游离。"
    wangshuang "Not quite. Everyone who can still reach this place has come adrift from the plain process. When they leave, I'd like them to at least know why they drifted."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:988
translate english route1_start_addf9cc1:

    # ahe "唔，所以这也是你的实验的一部分，带课题的。"
    ahe "Hmm. So it's part of your experiment. With a question attached."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:990
translate english route1_start_ab96f0c8:

    # wangshuang "不不不，这只是一个治疗场所而已。不过对于你来说...哼哼。"
    wangshuang "No, no, no. It's a place of treatment, nothing more. Though in your case...heh heh."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:991
translate english route1_start_60a0bac3:

    # ahe "怎么了？"
    ahe "What's wrong?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:994
translate english route1_start_55c84232:

    # ahe "可你说它没有意义。"
    ahe "But you said it was meaningless."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:996
translate english route1_start_bb533a62:

    # wangshuang "嗯，现在我也维持原判。"
    wangshuang "Yea. And I stand by it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:999
translate english route1_start_614976e7:

    # wangshuang "不想知道为什么？"
    wangshuang "Don't you want to know why?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:1000
translate english route1_start_7b5714fb:

    # ahe "不是很想。"
    ahe "Not really."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:1002
translate english route1_start_572348a0:

    # wangshuang "行吧。毕竟我们有得是时间。"
    wangshuang "Fine. It's not like we're short on time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:1007
translate english route1_start_72c04788:

    # wangshuang "喏——"
    wangshuang "Here——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:1010
translate english route1_start_b1df7673:

    # ahe "啊——！"
    ahe "Ahhh—!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:1014
translate english route1_start_41857261:

    # wangshuang "因为欧按物昆咽——"
    wangshuang "Becorseieoawuonnkyai——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:1015
translate english route1_start_757a790c:

